  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="42">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 42</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And se þe Godes utlagan ofer þone andagan, þe se cyngc sette, hæbbe on gewealde, plihte to him sylfum ⁊ ealre his are wið Cristes gespelian þe Cristendom ⁊ cynedon healdað ⁊ wealdað, þa hwile þe þæs God geann.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who keeps under his protection an excommunicated man, beyond the term fixed by the king, shall be in danger of forfeiting his life and all his property to the deputies of Christ, who shall be the defenders and upholders of the Christian religion and the royal authority, as long as God shall permit.</ab>
      </div>
